Social Connections
•	Friend search.
•	Follow and unfollow functionality.
•	Notifications for social activities.
Trip Host and Member Management
•	Host-controlled trip creation.
•	Trip invitations through 6-digit short codes.
•	Pending invitation banners.
•	Member role and permission management.
Collaborative Trip Planning
•	Real-time destination polling.
•	Trip locking and unlocking.
•	Voting deadline management.
•	Tabbed itinerary organization:
o	Activities
o	Stays
o	Transpo
•	Custom text-based itinerary notes.
•	Google Places spot recommendations.
Group Expense Ledger
•	Categorized expense tracking.
•	Multi-member expense splitting.
•	Debt calculation and audit previews.
Barkada Radar
•	Live member location visibility.
•	Trip-based location context.
•	Real-time member markers on the map.
AI Travel Assistant
•	Dual-engine AI using Google Gemini with Groq as a fallback.
•	Travel chatbot functionality.
•	PHP currency conversion.
•	Place photos.
•	Google Maps links.
•	Local spot caching through Supabase.
Limitations
•	Third-Party API Limits: AI recommendation throughput and Google Places image fetching are subject to external API rate limits, quotas, and service availability.
•	Device GPS Dependency: Real-time Barkada Radar updates depend on active internet connectivity, user-granted location permissions, and device GPS availability.
•	Trip Coordination Only: The application is intended for trip coordination purposes only and does not process actual bank transfers or payments.
•	No Direct Booking or Navigation: The application does not provide real-time turn-by-turn navigation or handle actual flight and hotel bookings. It only provides travel suggestions and links to external booking platforms.
•	Currency Conversion: Currency conversion figures are provided for reference purposes only and do not represent guaranteed exchange rates or actual currency exchange execution.
•	Opt-In Location Tracking: Location tracking is opt-in, trip-scoped, and automatically disabled once a trip ends.

